# Terraform / OpenTofu — never commit state, plans, or secret vars.
# The dependency lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) is NOT ignored — it must be committed.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json